"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"25:5","t":"And they say, \"Legends of the former peoples which he has written down, and they are dictated to him morning and afternoon.\"","j":18,"h":36,"s":25,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"25:6","t":"Say, [O Muḥammad], \"It has been revealed by He who knows [every] secret within the heavens and the earth. Indeed, He is ever Forgiving and Merciful.\"","j":18,"h":36,"s":25,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"25:7","t":"And they say, \"What is this messenger that eats food and walks in the markets? Why was there not sent down to him an angel so he would be with him a warner?","j":18,"h":36,"s":25,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"25:8","t":"Or [why is not] a treasure presented to him [from heaven], or does he [not] have a garden from which he eats?\" And the wrongdoers say, \"You follow not but a man affected by magic.\"","j":18,"h":36,"s":25,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"25:9","t":"Look how they strike for you comparisons; but they have strayed, so they cannot [find] a way.","j":18,"h":36,"s":25,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"25:10","t":"Blessed is He who, if He willed, could have made for you [something] better than that - gardens beneath which rivers flow - and could make for you palaces.","j":18,"h":36,"s":25,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"25:11","t":"But they have denied the Hour, and We have prepared for those who deny the Hour a Blaze.","j":18,"h":36,"s":25,"a":11,"sd":null}],"juz":18,"hizb":36,"surahs":[25],"sajdah":false}